PP | humanoid | w1 | legr  | 0 | 2  | 0
PP | humanoid | w1 | armr  | 0 | 2  | 0
PP | humanoid | w1 | handr | 0 | 2  | 0
PP | humanoid | w1 | arml  | 0 | -2 | 0
PP | humanoid | w1 | handl | 0 | -2 | 0
