# EQUIPMENT (D30 step 3): visuals only. Stats stay in db-hq (armors.pdl, weapons.pdl): one authority per fact.
# EQ | id | slot | item | part | x | y | z | w | d | h | colour | follow
#   slot: weapon shield head body accessory (the house equipment types).   item: the db-hq name (checked by `check-equip`), or - when no database row exists yet.
#   follow: a body part whose pose offsets this part copies (a weapon follows handr, a shield handl), or -.   Expressions use the same variables as PS (tx bw lh hx hw).
#   Used by the knob  equip=id,id,...  (one item per slot).
EQ | leather_cap   | head      | Leather Cap   | cap    | hx      | 9  | lh+10 | hw   | 5 | 2 | #8a5a3a | -
